  "body": "* 4 bedrooms | 3 bathrooms | 1 garage\r\n* 164 sqm floor area | 211 sqm land\r\n* Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n* Modern kitchen with generous bench space and ample storage\r\n* Easy indoor-outdoor flow to the deck and outdoor area\r\n* One bedroom on the ground floor, with three bedrooms upstairs\r\n* Separate upstairs family area for added flexibility\r\n* Master bedroom with its own ensuite\r\n* Elevated position with outlook across the surrounding area\r\n* Zoned for Orewa College and Dairy Flat School\r\n* Close to shopping, transport and motorway connections\r\n\r\nStep inside 7 Wira Lane and discover a modern home with a practical two-level layout designed for comfortable everyday living.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the ground floor is a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. The contemporary kitchen offers generous bench space, ample cabinetry and a clean, modern finish, with a practical layout that connects naturally with the dining and living spaces. Large windows and doors bring in plenty of natural light while opening the living area to the outdoor deck.\r\n\r\nA bedroom on the ground floor adds flexibility to the home, providing a convenient option for guests, extended family or those who prefer easier access to the main living areas. A bathroom is also located on this level, adding to the practicality of the layout.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master bedroom is complemented by its own ensuite, alongside two additional bedrooms and the main bathroom. A separate family area provides another space to relax away from the main living zone, whether for reading, children's activities or simply enjoying some extra room to unwind.\r\n\r\nOutside, the deck extends the living space and provides a relaxed setting to enjoy the elevated outlook. Whether it is morning coffee, an evening drink or time with family and friends, the outdoor area adds another layer of versatility to the home.\r\n\r\nA single garage provides secure parking and practical storage, while the 164 sqm floor area on a 211 sqm site offers a comfortable balance of indoor and outdoor space.\r\n\r\nConveniently positioned in Silverdale, this home is close to Silverdale Mall, local shops, cafés, restaurants, parks and the wider Hibiscus Coast. Hibiscus Coast Station & Park & Ride are also nearby, with easy access to motorway connections for commuting. Families will appreciate the convenient school zoning, including Orewa College and Dairy Flat School.\r\n\r\nModern, light-filled and thoughtfully arranged across two levels, 7 Wira Lane offers a comfortable home with the flexibility to suit a range of family needs.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
